      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SCRUB'S BLUE (1) has a strong record this track and trip with eight wins and six placings from 16 starts. Was out of the placings last time (30.66) at Q Parklands in a Grade 5, finishing eighth and beaten 16 lengths. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. CAMBLA DIVA (3) goes very well at the course and distance with five wins and a placing from eight starts. In the money last time at Q Parklands (29.97) in a Grade 5, finishing a nose second. Looks a key chance on best figures. MAGIC SHAZAM (6) stuck on well last time to finish one length back in second (22.00) at this track in a Grade 3/4 over 390m. Has never been out of the placings from four starts out of this box. Will give a great sight again. SHIMA POLLY (2) form at this course and distance reads well.",
